OL,3,AIranian authorities flog singer who
OL,4,Aperformed without hijab, lawyers say
OL,5,
OL,6,FThis June, a criminal court in Qom
OL,7,Fconvicted Ahmadi and eight others of
OL,8,F"offending public decency" through the
OL,9,Fpublication of "obscene and indecent
OL,10,Fmaterial", which they had denied.
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/39
